   "title": "PAF SV path: REMOTE, demand, BUMPLESS ramp, house operation",
   "drawing": "SV T switch A = SI0160: demand SI0045 through BUMPLESS RAMP 0.05 %/sec of 648 T/H = 0.324 T/H per second; 1:BYPASS = FICFA1071.LOC (LOCAL = demand passed directly). In house operation (M.025B) the SV is the 230 T/H setting at rate limit 0.5T/Sec; the rate limit is bypassed (⊠ = NOT) when NOT in house operation, so it follows the PV immediately (T switch a = FICFA1071.PV). Demand SI0045 comes from ABC-002 (circle PAD/002), so it is set on ABC-002 and the effect is checked here.",
   "steps": [
    {
     "do": "set",
     "tag": "M.3302",
     "value": 1
    },
    {
     "do": "set",
     "tag": "M.3303",
     "value": 1
    },
    {
     "do": "wait",
     "s": 10
    },
    {
     "do": "press",
     "button": "REMOTE",
     "say": "Press REMOTE (SV from logic)"
    },
    {
     "expect": "sv-switch",
     "value": "A (logic / REMOTE)",
     "say": "SV switch after REMOTE"
    },
    {
     "expect": "mode",
     "value": "AUTO",
     "say": "Mode (REMOTE = actually AUTO)"
    },
    {
     "do": "set",
     "tag": "FICFA1071.LOC",
     "value": 1
    },
    {
     "do": "set",
     "tag": "SI0045",
     "value": 300,
     "sheet": "ABC-002"
    },
    {
     "do": "wait",
     "s": 3
    },
    {
     "expect": "signal",
     "tag": "SI0160",
     "value": 300,
     "tol": 1,
     "say": "SI0160 in LOCAL (ramp bypassed)",
